RedCrystal.glyph.Button.name=Button
RedCrystal.glyph.Button.desc=A button that send a pulse signal when pressed
items.RedCrystal.staff.name=Glyph Carver
items.RedCrystal.staff.desc=A powerful tool used to carve red glyphs on walls \nUse [Ability 1] to select the glyph\nUse [Primary Action] to place glyph or edit settings\nUse [Secondary Action] to remove glyphs or links
items.RedCrystal.sliver.name=Red Crystal Sliver
items.RedCrystal.sliver.desc=Slowly Replenish Any Glyph Carver with missing durability in your hotbar and get consumed in the process
# === InteractionHints ===
RedCrystal.interactionHints.input=Input\nLeft Click to create link\nRight Click to break link
RedCrystal.interactionHints.output=Output\nLeft Click to create link\nRight Click to break link
RedCrystal.glyph.Interact.name=Interactor
RedCrystal.glyph.Interact.desc=An element that can interact with blocks the same way a player can, you can open doors, toggle lights, etc.

# === Glyphs ===
RedCrystal.glyph.OrG.name=OR Gate
RedCrystal.glyph.OrG.desc=A binary OR gate
RedCrystal.glyph.XOrG.name=XOR Gate
RedCrystal.glyph.XOrG.desc=A binary absolute OR gate
RedCrystal.glyph.AndG.name=AND Gate
RedCrystal.glyph.AndG.desc=A binary AND gate, inputs not properly connected are not taken into account
RedCrystal.glyph.NotG.name=NOT Gate
RedCrystal.glyph.NotG.desc=A binary NOT gate, inverting received signal
RedCrystal.glyph.Inverter.name=Inverter
RedCrystal.glyph.Inverter.desc=An analog gate that invert the incoming signal
RedCrystal.glyph.Relay.name=Relay
RedCrystal.glyph.Relay.desc=Transfer signal without altering it
RedCrystal.glyph.Toggle.name=Toggle
RedCrystal.glyph.Toggle.desc=Switch state from ON to OFF every pulse
RedCrystal.glyph.Lever.name=Lever
RedCrystal.glyph.Lever.desc=Allow to manually toggle between ON and OFF signal
RedCrystal.glyph.Variator.name=Variator
RedCrystal.glyph.Variator.desc=Allow to manually select different strength of signal
RedCrystal.glyph.Light.name=Light
RedCrystal.glyph.Light.desc=Emit light which strength depend on signal intensity
RedCrystal.glyph.ColoredLight.name=Colored Light
RedCrystal.glyph.ColoredLight.desc=Use it's 3 inputs to define the Red,Green and Blue channels of the emitted light
RedCrystal.glyph.Fan.name=Fan
RedCrystal.glyph.Fan.desc=Push entity in front of it with a force and distance debending on the signal's strength
RedCrystal.glyph.CalcSubtract.name=Math: Subtract
RedCrystal.glyph.CalcSubtract.desc=Make a subtract operation\nA-B=C\n(A is the left input,B is the right input)
RedCrystal.glyph.CalcAdd.name=Math: Add
RedCrystal.glyph.CalcAdd.desc=Add the 2 inputs together\nA+B=C\n(A is the left input,B is the right input)
RedCrystal.glyph.CalcMod.name=Math: Modulo
RedCrystal.glyph.CalcMod.desc=Make a modulo operation\nA%B=C\n(A is the left input,B is the right input)
RedCrystal.glyph.CalcDivide.name=Math: Divide
RedCrystal.glyph.CalcDivide.desc=Make a divide operation\nA/B=C\n(A is the left input,B is the right input)
RedCrystal.glyph.CalcMultiply.name=Math: Multiply
RedCrystal.glyph.CalcMultiply.desc=Make a multiply operation\nA*B=C\n(A is the left input,B is the right input)
RedCrystal.glyph.NumberDisplay.name=Number Display
RedCrystal.glyph.NumberDisplay.desc=Display the input strength as floating number
RedCrystal.glyph.PreciseInput.name=Precise Input
RedCrystal.glyph.PreciseInput.desc=Allow to precisely set the strength of the signal
RedCrystal.glyph.Delayer.name=Delayer
RedCrystal.glyph.Delayer.desc=Replicate the input signal but with a configurable delay
RedCrystal.glyphSetting.global.Visibility.name=Visibility
RedCrystal.glyphSetting.global.Visibility.desc=Set Glyph's visibility:\n -Hidden: Shown only when powered\n -Visible: Always shown\n -Pulse: Only Show signal changing\n -Invisible: Never shown
RedCrystal.glyphSetting.Delayer.DelayBehaviorTime.name=Delay in seconds
RedCrystal.glyphSetting.Delayer.DelayBehaviorTime.desc=The delay in seconds between input an output, can have decimal
RedCrystal.glyphSetting.PressurePlate.PressurePlateBehaviorItemCheck.name=Detect Items
RedCrystal.glyphSetting.PressurePlate.PressurePlateBehaviorItemCheck.desc=Uncheck to prevent thrown item to trigger the plate
RedCrystal.glyphSetting.PressurePlate.PressurePlateBehaviorHidePlate.name=Hide Plate
RedCrystal.glyphSetting.PressurePlate.PressurePlateBehaviorHidePlate.desc=Make the Pressure Plate Model invisible
RedCrystal.glyph.PressurePlate.name=Pressure Plate
RedCrystal.glyph.PressurePlate.desc=Trigger when an entity collide with it
RedCrystal.glyphSetting.Piston.PistonBehaviorExtend.name=Extend Distance
RedCrystal.glyphSetting.Piston.PistonBehaviorExtend.desc=The distance the blocks can be pushed
RedCrystal.glyphSetting.Piston.PistonBehaviorGrab.name=Block Amount
RedCrystal.glyphSetting.Piston.PistonBehaviorGrab.desc=The number of blocks in that can be grabbed
RedCrystal.glyph.Piston.name=Block Pusher
RedCrystal.glyph.Piston.desc=Push a selected number of blocks in a row in a configurable direction.\nThe blocs pushed will be at the opposite direction of the glyph\n The distance of push is also based on signal strength.\n Unpowering the Sigil will bring the pushed blocks back